<title>JAPAN: Kawaguchi Chem up on profit hunt.</title>
<headline>Kawaguchi Chem up on profit hunt.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Kawaguchi Chemical Industry Co Ltd were higher in early afternoon trade on Thursday  buoyed by investors hoping to get short-term profits from the shares, brokers said.</p>
<p>At 0446 GMT, the shares were 80 yen higher at 1,020 yen.  </p>
<p>Brokers said the shares were attracting attention as the company was stable and market activity was very thin.</p>
</text>
